-- Paragraph 5(3): a person is specified if they are a claimant, or a child or qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible,
-- and in receipt of one of the seven listed payments (the list module).
-- src:2087 | (3) A person is specified in this sub-paragraph if the person is—
-- src:2088 | (a) a claimant or any child or qualifying young person for whom a claimant is responsible; and
-- src:2089 | (b) in receipt of—
